    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Veiled Blade Elimination Force",
    "summary": "Your OFFICIO ASSASSINORUM units may use each of Shieldbreaker, Soulless Horror and Overkill two times per battle rather than once, though never twice in a single battle round. While mustering, each OFFICIO ASSASSINORUM unit automatically gains its matching Extremis ability and its points cost rises by the listed amount; a unit that would take the army over the battle's points limit cannot be included. Decoy Targets (CALLIDUS ASSASSIN, +15 points): up to two times per battle, during a Movement phase of yours, pick another friendly INFANTRY model on the battlefield that is outside Engagement Range of all enemies. It is destroyed without triggering any destroyed-model rules, and the CALLIDUS ASSASSIN is removed and placed again as near as possible to that spot, outside Engagement Range of every enemy unit; this happens at most once per battle round. Esoteric Explosives (CULEXUS ASSASSIN, +10 points): whenever the Grenades Stratagem targets it, each D6 of 3+ rather than 4+ inflicts 1 mortal wound. Intraneural Biotech (EVERSOR ASSASSIN, +15 points): Heroic Intervention can target it even if that Stratagem was already used this phase; that use costs 1 CP less, and other units can still receive that Stratagem in the same phase. Micromelta Rounds (VINDICARE ASSASSIN, +20 points): its exitus rifle gains [ANTI-VEHICLE 4+] and [ANTI-MONSTER 4+].",
